    "collections.itemCount" : {
      "comment" : "Number of items in a collection: under the collection's name on a library's Collections tab (Android phone; Apple tvOS (Apple TV) shows it in uppercase on the poster card) and beside the sort and filter buttons on a collection's page (Android TV). Apple iOS also uses it for the number of items in watch history. {count}: the number of items; {count_text}: the same number as digits.",
