    "player.subtitleSync.noticeApplying" : {
      "comment" : "Apple iOS/tvOS/macOS: Title of the subtitle sync card in the player's top-trailing corner (iOS, tvOS, macOS). Shown after a sync finished while the corrected subtitles reload. Android phone and TV player subtitle timing: same title of the sync card.",
