    "player.subtitleSync.noticeFailed" : {
      "comment" : "Apple iOS/tvOS/macOS: Title of the subtitle sync card in the player's top-trailing corner (iOS, tvOS, macOS). Shown when a sync failed; the reason follows on a second line. 1: subtitle language name, such as English, or the track's label. Android phone and TV player subtitle timing: same title of the sync card. 1: the subtitle's language name.",
