    "settings.overview.signInSubtitle" : {
      "comment" : "Apple Settings overview (iPhone, iPad): description of the Sign-in row, read by VoiceOver as the row's hint. A sign-in provider is an outside service (such as single sign-on) used to sign in to Silo.",
