    "settings.profileLaunch.afterTwelveHours.detail" : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under the After 12 Hours profile selection choice: in the Roku profile picker, on Android, and in Apple Settings > General profile selection (iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple TV). Who's Watching is the name of the profile picker screen.",
