    "signInTv.serverAccount" : {
      "comment" : "Phone text on the TV approval card explaining what will happen. {server}: the server name; {account}: the account name that will be used. Apple (iPhone, iPad): same text on the Sign in a TV approval card and the nearby-TV pairing card; {server} is the server name with its host.",
